        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Violet’s marriage is falling apart.</strong> One night, in a desperate attempt to make things right, she ventures into a mysterious forest, determined to gather the cherished belongings that once brought joy to her husband. But the woods are filled with secrets: a strange <i>will-o’-the-wisp</i> appears again and again, its intent unclear - friend or foe? As Nordic folklore comes to life around her, the line between reality and memory begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/9136c82acaec2c81f1de47b5eca34f86.avif?t=1787566107\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras_big/9136c82acaec2c81f1de47b5eca34f86.avif?t=1787566107 width=800 height=267 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Journey into Darkness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On her search for the lost fragments of her relationship, Violet encounters strange objects and enigmatic creatures. Some seem familiar, others frighten with their strangeness. As she ventures deeper into this surreal forest, the line between reality and delusion begins to blur. Things appear that shouldn’t exist, memories twist, and every decision can lead her fate further into an unexpected direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/a2c0d1d2a2895b0510a7ac61eaa41b52.poster.avif?t=1787566107\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/a2c0d1d2a2895b0510a7ac61eaa41b52.webm?t=1787566107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/a2c0d1d2a2895b0510a7ac61eaa41b52.mp4?t=1787566107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore. Uncover. Remember.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through the eerie woods and uncover their hidden secrets. Collect scattered clues like fragments of Violet’s past and interact with mysterious objects that sometimes promise answers… and sometimes only raise new questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to Violet’s voice as her thoughts, doubts, and longings come to life. Every step and every spoken word brings you closer to the truth… or drives you further into madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/1c27514b4832a66658d981a886fe1586.poster.avif?t=1787566107\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/1c27514b4832a66658d981a886fe1586.webm?t=1787566107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/1c27514b4832a66658d981a886fe1586.mp4?t=1787566107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything Changes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What once felt familiar may vanish in the blink of an eye. New paths open, and known places shift their appearance. The forest lives and transforms with every step you take. Nothing remains the same, and each discovery pulls you further into a labyrinth of secrets that will never let you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/dac4eee925acd74313d3dfb3d9eab616.poster.avif?t=1787566107\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/dac4eee925acd74313d3dfb3d9eab616.webm?t=1787566107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/dac4eee925acd74313d3dfb3d9eab616.mp4?t=1787566107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices That Matter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape not only her path, but also the reality around her. Are you ready to lose yourself and uncover every hidden truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/319e164c6ed5575ff76f86413c29a9c4.avif?t=1787566107\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras_big/319e164c6ed5575ff76f86413c29a9c4.avif?t=1787566107 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story told through 2D exploration in a surreal setting</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel passages with two possible endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep psychological story about love, loss, and madness</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique visual scenes and illustrations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark atmosphere and subtle horror</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey between reality, memory and delusion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You want more? Check out the Creator's new Game 'the Doll Museum'!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815140/extras/3a1c2fe4a176d3fc0bda80d492a6ba01.avif?t=1787566107\" width=1560 height=436 /></span></p>",
